    "summary": "Model eligibility — **SORCERER** or **EXALTED SORCERER**. **Kine‑shielded Guardians** gives the bearer **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** if a friendly unit with **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** is inside its 3\" radius. Use **Soul Bound** during your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) at either endpoint of the bearer’s unit move. You may choose a friendly unit with **SEKHETAR ROBOTS** inside the bearer’s 3\" radius. It **heals** D3+1 wounds.",
